摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"为 DeepSeek Harness 提供会话删除能力，支持侧边栏 ⋮ 菜单入口","id":"gh:1333738556","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-session-cleaner","slug":"fountunt/dsh-session-cleaner","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","session-manager"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"为 DeepSeek Harness 提供会话删除能力，支持侧边栏 ⋮ 菜单入口"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-session-cleaner"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Delete DeepSeek Harness sessions from a **running** web runtime — files, live\nstore, and workspace r"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ecords — without restarting `dsh web`."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"The official web API only offers `workspace.archiveSession` (hide); there is no\n`session.delete`. Th"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"is bundle closes that gap."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Then restart `dsh web` (a running instance does not hot-load new bundles)."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Web UI (v1.0.0)"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The client half adds a **🗑 \"Delete session\" item** at the bottom of the\nsidebar session row ⋮ menu —"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" the item is skipped when the row title is\nambiguous (duplicate titles)."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Click, confirm, and the session is deleted and the sidebar refreshes. The\nitem is disabled (greyed) "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"while the session is running; sessions opened in\nthe UI (idle agents) are stopped first, then delete"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"d. The current running\nconversation can never be deleted."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### API"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The plugin registers one route on the web server:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Same-origin calls work from the browser console of the harness page:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Response envelope (mirrors the host's RPC style):"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- `detached` — the session was removed from the in-memory live store (this is\nwhat makes it disappea"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"r from the sidebar immediately, without a restart).\n- `workspaces` — how many workspace records the "},{"id":"p20s3","text":"session was detached from.\n- `files` — how many on-disk artifact directories were removed."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Safety"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- Sessions with an attached agent (running or idle) are **refused** — the\ncurrent conversation can n"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ever be deleted through this endpoint.\n- Deletion is irreversible: artifacts, workspace membership, "},{"id":"p22s3","text":"and the live\nentry are all removed. The session-projection cache may keep a harmless\nstale row until"},{"id":"p22s4","text":" are all removed. The session-projection cache may keep a harmless\nstale row until the next restart."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"`session.list` is served from the live `SessionStore` plus a disk scan. Cold\nsessions get *prepared "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"into the live store* while being listed, so after their\nfiles are deleted they linger as \"ghosts\" un"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"til the server restarts. This\nplugin removes the live entry (the store's own detach path), detaches "},{"id":"p24s4","text":"the\nsession from workspace records, and deletes the on-disk artifact directory —\nso the row disappea"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"rs immediately and permanently."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
